{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起自己从前连表达喜欢都紧张，如今已经能够与对方亲近，决定不再把喜欢藏起来。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心软、发酸、温热、慢慢平静\",\n      \"missed\": \"他仍然舍不得、仍不知道以后会怎样，但不再逼自己索要永远不变的保证，这层心理转折需要读第二段才能完整抓到。右侧九条关系变化也不容易一眼理清。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他从不敢表达喜欢走到愿意让对方看见，开始接受眼下的亲近，不再急着确定以后。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"发酸、温热、平静、柔软，带一点松弛和余韵\",\n      \"missed\": \"熟悉的摇荡、夜空里最后一闪，以及开头没说完的话终于说完，这些画面和人物处境之间的具体联系一眼不够明确；仍不知道以后会怎样的心理背景需要读大字。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他已经让对方看见自己的喜欢，不再藏回去，也不再急着要一个关于未来的保证，先接受眼下。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"温热、平静、柔软、略带不舍\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的‘小船一下定住、站起来整理衣服、轻轻关上门’形成了具体动作画面，但一眼不容易确认这些动作对应人物处境中的哪一刻；‘醒来还记得光’也需要进一步读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三段大字都很醒目，但长度相近、视觉权重也相近，第一眼不容易确定最应该抓住哪一段。右侧九条关系变化和下方多组短语又形成另一套信息层次。人物的心理变化和感受本身是连贯的，尤其‘不再藏着喜欢’与‘不再逼问以后’能够串起来；相对薄弱的是部分画面短语，特别是小船停住、整理衣服、轻轻关门，与人物当下的关系处境之间缺少一眼就能看出的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c5a9d62a-7bb0-4acd-aad8-969fbb836e35", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T004904867890Z", "elapsed_seconds": 98.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:50:42.893384+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f246118348285cca170de79d25d66cb9174ce7887819d609979641de809a3162", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T004904867890Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "9857517ef894b84dff9619795c00362fdf24f246400e4cbab28960d610c3e5a8"}}}
